BT 1 0 0 1 0 39.6 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.2 TL (This application allocates adjacent seats to parties of one to four people. Customers register for a sale, receive a queue) Tj T* (position when the sale opens, and receive a whole-party reservation if a suitable block exists. A mock payment confirms the) Tj T* (reservation. Unpaid reservations expire; customers can cancel an unpaid reservation. No money or real payment details are) Tj T* (involved.) Tj T* ET
